   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The agreement of case in the apposition",
     "texto": [
      "An apposition works like an explanatory parenthesis that shares the syntactic function of the head it accompanies:",
      "1. **In nominative**: **Frau Dr. Weber, [die renommierte Expertin], übernimmt die Führung** (subject).",
      "2. **In dative**: **Wir gratulieren Herrn Becker, [unserem erfahrenen Ingenieur], zum Erfolg** (dative object).",
      "3. **In accusative**: **Sie wählten Herrn Klein, [einen geschätzten Kollegen], zum Sprecher** (accusative object).",
      "4. **In genitive**: **Das Votum des Aufsichtsrats, [unseres obersten Kontrollgremiums], war eindeutig** (noun complement).",
      "It is a frequent error not to close the apposition with the second comma when the main clause continues."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Position and case",
     "columnas": [
